---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import PortraitPlaceholder from '../components/PortraitPlaceholder.astro';
import { site } from '../config/site';
// TODO: replace the two prose blocks below with your own bio (roles, employers, focus).
---
<BaseLayout title="About" currentPath="/about"><section class="hero"><div><p class="mono muted">ABOUT / IDENTITY</p><h1>{site.name}<br/><span class="muted">{site.nickname}</span></h1><p class="lede">{site.summary}</p>{site.cvHref && <p><a class="stamp mono" href={site.cvHref}>DOWNLOAD CV</a></p>}</div><PortraitPlaceholder /></section><section class="section prose"><h2>What I work on</h2><p>Most of my time goes to offensive security and to the tooling around it: recon and enumeration that does not fall apart on a large scope, scanners that produce findings someone can actually verify, and Burp extensions that cut the boring part of a test down to the part worth thinking about.</p><p>The other half is automation. I build MCP servers and agent integrations so an assistant can drive real tools — nmap, dirsearch, Splunk — under constraints I set, instead of guessing. I also keep a public pentest wiki, because notes I cannot find again were never notes.</p><h2>Elsewhere</h2><ul>{site.socialLinks.map((link) => <li><a href={link.href}>{link.label}</a></li>)}</ul></section></BaseLayout>
